        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="DEw_17VJEXmFvSOf3hYK-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b&gt;- Operator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Creates missions, which requires creating a marker and receiving GPS coordinates&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Can optionally allocate UAVs to missions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Starts missions, which requires capturing UAV images and feeding commands, including assigning a search area&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Can optionally evaluate missions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Can optionally monitor missions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- GPS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Provides GPS coordinates, which is required when an Operator creates a mission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- UAV Image&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Interacts with the system to capture images, which is required when an Operator starts a mission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- UAVs Search&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Participates in allocating UAVs, which is optional when an Operator creates a mission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Interacts with the system to feed commands, which requires assigning a search area. Feeding commands is required when an Operator starts a mission&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;- Server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Participates in assigning a search area, which is required when feeding commands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Participates in starting missions, which&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;requires capturing images and feeding commands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Participates in sending commands&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="440" x="-40" y="-40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2sPzZx3OQcX7WFB5aiDO-1" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#f8cecc;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;labelBorderColor=#b85450;" value="" vertex="1">
